Z||000004||EdsB52||07-03-2001||03:39 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by DRH:<BR><B>Wouldn't an email to Cliff have been more appropriate? Why mislabel your thread if you really want an answer?<P>Cliff has let a LOT of stuff go by on here in the past, including flames against Archie. I find it hard to believe he has an axe to grind. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Email would have been more appropriate to his/their agenda? Isn't it obvious why I mislabeled my post? Come on, what was the major premise of this post, not the original post, this one? It was the censorship of my first post. If I posted with the original topic statement, it would have been spotted and removed. I'm sure some good little trooper will run (email) to Cliff and tell him long before we get to 10 replies. Cliff will probably then remove it, hence proving my contention. If he has character, he'll let this post stand and go away. <P>Are you for real? No one has contended Cliff has "an axe to grind." I can't believe you missed the boat by that much. I merely stated that he has a commercial venture here, not a casual Fiero forum. This is evidenced by the fact that Cliff didn't remove the Fierolisa post, just closed it after something like 40 replies, some defamatory.||||reg||1
Z||000005||DRH||07-03-2001||03:58 PM||||So you didn't really want answers to your questions? <P>OK, axe to grind was bad wording. What do you mean by commercial venture? His digital dashes? If he's living off the profit on those based on anything I've seen about them on here, he's starving to death... Where do you see him making money on here?<P>In 2 years of being on here I've only seen a VERY few post deleted These were all by some newly registered idiots openly flaming ALL Fieros. I have also seen many derogatory comments about Archie (and others) NOT deleted. I honestly think you were just at the wrong place the wrong time on this one.<P><BR>||||reg||1
