Z||000007||Cliff Pennock||07-03-2001||04:22 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by EdsB52:<BR><B>The post above was removed within minutes or hours of original posting. I don't know the relationship between Cliff and Archie, but I now know that economic politics play a part in this club.<P>Now Cliff, you can remove this post, you can ban me from the club, you can even report me to Yahoo or whom ever you want. But you will never successfully sensor me, so let this post stand and go away. All you're doing by removing my posts is substantiating my contentions. I'm not trying to harm your commercial enterprise, just merely defend my position. I could email everyone in the club with this information from an anonymous computer, so don't think you can shut me up.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>You have got to be ******* kidding me. Don't go that way. Don't even think of going that way. I'll tell you why I deleted that post. Because it's my ******* forum on my ******* server and I can do whatever I damn well feel like doing. Don't like it? Well boo-*******-hoo. I will <B>not</B> give you <B>any</B> explanation. If you can't grasp the simpel notion of off-topic posting, than you have no business here anyway.<P>And don't you <B>ever</B> tell me what I should or shouldn't do on my own ******* forum again.||||reg||1
